              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6899' id='15' type-v2='text' w='98684' x='658' y='800'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>FAIL RATE BREAKDOWN</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#f4077f' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='15901' id='16' type-v2='text' w='98684' x='658' y='7699'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>- Select</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>desired</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'> perspective</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'> to break down fail rate (FR) and toggle the respective dynamic </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>perspective filters. </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>- Click on</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f4077f' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='8'>[+] on </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f4077f' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='8'>Persp #X</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f4077f' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f4077f' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='8'>column</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f4077f' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>to expand to the next </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f4077f' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='8'>Perspective </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>when multiple hierarchies are chosen.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>- Rows are </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>sorted by total orders </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>descending.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>- For </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>cancellation type and decline reason perspectives</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>, FR =  failed orders per cancellation type/decline reason divided by total orders in APAC or in the preceding perspective. For example:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>       - If </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>Country ▸ Cancellation Type </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>is chosen, FR = failed auto or manual cancelled orders / total orders in that country.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>       - If </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>Country ▸ Chain ▸ Vendor ▸ Decline Reason </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>is chosen, FR = failed orders per decline reason / total orders in that vendor.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>- For </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>cancellation type and decline reason perspectives</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>, Null refers to valid orders and should be ignored. </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>- For </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>pelican status</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#f4077f' fontsize='8'>, pelican/godroid categorisation is done at order level here. In contrast, Ops Deep Dive dashboard categorises at a chain level, thus figures could differ. </run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  <format attr='padding-top' value='2' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#f5f5f5' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
